sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Admin
  participant A as API (AdminController)
  participant G as AuthGuard + RolesGuard
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant R as Redis (BullMQ)
  M->>A: POST /admin/ai-jobs/:id/retry (Bearer JWT)
  A->>G: xác minh JWT (HS256), role = ADMIN?
  alt không phải ADMIN
    G-->>M: 403 FORBIDDEN
  end
  A->>D: SELECT AIJob WHERE id
  alt không tồn tại
    A-->>M: 404 NOT_FOUND
  else status ≠ FAILED
    A-->>M: 409 CONFLICT
  else type ≠ GENERATE_LESSONS
    A-->>M: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
  else hợp lệ
    A->>D: UPDATE AIJob SET QUEUED, progress 0, error null
    A->>R: add lesson-generate với inputParams gốc
    A->>D: INSERT AuditLog ai_job.retry { previousStatus, previousError }
    A-->>M: 200 AdminAiJobDetail
  end
